 21:16:40'),(426,'home_value8_desc','与人为善，助人为乐，和睦邻里互敬互爱','2026-06-14 21:16:40','2026-06-14 21:16:40'),(428,'home_value5_icon','❤️','2026-06-14 21:16:40','2026-06-14 21:16:40'),(429,'home_value6_desc','爱岗敬业，尽职尽责，精益求精追求卓越','2026-06-14 21:16:40','2026-06-14 21:16:40'),(430,'home_value8_title','友善','2026-06-14 21:16:40','2026-06-14 21:16:40'),(432,'home_value8_icon','?','2026-06-14 21:16:40','2026-06-14 21:16:40'),(433,'home_value6_title','敬业','2026-06-14 21:16:40','2026-06-14 21:16:40'),(435,'home_value7_title','诚信','2026-06-14 21:16:40','2026-06-14 21:16:40'),(436,'home_value3_icon','?‍?‍?‍?','2026-06-14 21:16:40','2026-06-14 21:16:40'),(437,'home_value6_icon','?','2026-06-14 21:16:40','2026-06-14 21:16:40'),(438,'home_value7_desc','诚实守信，言行一致，重信守约说到做到','2026-06-14 21:16:40','2026-06-14 21:16:40'),(440,'home_value7_icon','?','2026-06-14 21:16:40','2026-06-14 21:16:40'),(441,'home_value1_icon','?','2026-06-14 21:16:40','2026-06-14 21:16:40');
